{"subject":"math3","year":2020,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math3-2020-1","num":1,"desc":"导数定义","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】∵ $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a}\\dfrac{f(x)-a}{x-a}=b$ ∴ $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a}f(x)=a$，","设 $f(x)=u$，则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a}\\dfrac{\\sin f(x)-\\sin a}{f(x)-a}=\\lim\\limits_{u\\to a}\\dfrac{\\sin u-\\sin a}{u-a}=\\cos a$，","则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a}\\dfrac{\\sin f(x)-\\sin a}{x-a}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a}\\dfrac{\\sin f(x)-\\sin a}{f(x)-a}\\cdot\\lim\\limits_{x\\to a}\\dfrac{f(x)-a}{x-a}=b\\cos a$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-2","num":2,"desc":"间断点及其分类","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】本题考查的是第一类间断点与第二类间断点的定义，判断间断点及类型的一般步骤为：①找出无定义的点（无意义的点）；②求该点的左右极限；③按照间断点的定义判定.","第二类间断点的定义为 $f_{-}(x_{0}),f_{+}(x_{0})$ 至少有一个不存在，很显然 $f(x)$ 不存在的点为$x=-1,x=0,x=1,x=2$.","在 $x=-1$ 处，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-1^{-}}f(x)=-\\infty$, $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-1^{+}}f(x)=-\\infty$；","在 $x=0$ 处，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{-}}f(x)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}f(x)=-\\dfrac{1}{2e}$；","在 $x=1$ 处，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1^{-}}e^{\\frac{1}{x-1}}=0$ ， $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1^{+}}e^{\\frac{1}{x-1}}=+\\infty$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1^{-}}f(x)=0$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1^{+}}f(x)=-\\infty$；","在 $x=2$ 处，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to2^{-}}f(x)=-\\infty$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to2^{+}}f(x)=+\\infty$；","所以，第二类间断点为 3 个."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-3","num":3,"desc":"奇偶函数性质","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（A）","【解析】$f(x)$ 为奇函数，则其导数 $f'(x)$ 为偶函数，又 $\\cos x$ 为偶函数，则$\\cos f(x)=\\cos f(-x)$，则 $\\cos f(x)$ 为偶函数，故 $\\cos f(x)+f'(x)$ 为偶函数，以 0 为下限、被积函数为偶函数的变限积分函数为奇函数. 所以，本题选 $A$;对于 $C$ 和 $D$ 选项，$f'(x)$为偶函数，则 $\\cos f'(x)=\\cos f'(-x)$ 为偶函数，$f(x)$ 为奇函数，则 $\\cos f'(x)+f(x)$ 既非奇函数又非偶函数."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-4","num":4,"desc":"幂级数收敛半径与收敛区间","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】由比值法可知，幂级数收敛时，$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{a_{n+1}(x+1)^{2n+2}}{a_{n}(x+1)^{2n}}\\right|=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_{n}}\\right|(x+1)^{2}<1$，","则要求 $\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_{n}(x+2)^{2n}$ 的收敛区间，只需要求出 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_{n}}\\right|$ 的值即可，","而条件告诉我们幂级数 $\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}na_{n}(x-2)^{n}$ 的收敛区间为 $(-2,6)$，即收敛半径为 4，","$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{(n+1)a_{n+1}}{na_{n}}\\right|=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{n+1}{n}\\left|\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_{n}}\\right|=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_{n}}\\right|=\\dfrac{1}{4}$，","则 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_{n}}\\right|(x+1)^{2n}=\\dfrac{1}{4}(x+1)^{2}<1$，即 $-3<x<1$.","所以本题选（B）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-5","num":5,"desc":"伴随矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】$A=(a_{ij})$ 不可逆知，$|A|=0$ 及 $r(A)<4$；由 $A_{12}\\neq0$ 知 $A^{*}\\neq O$ 且 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{4}$ 线性无关（无关组的延长组仍无关），故 $r(A)=3$ 及 $r(A^{*})=1$，故 $A^{*}\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的基础解系含有 3 个向量. 由 $A^{*}A=|A|E=O$ 知，$A$ 的列向量均为 $A^{*}\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的解,故通解 $\\boldsymbol{x}=k_{1}\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+k_{2}\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}+k_{3}\\boldsymbol{a}_{4}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-6","num":6,"desc":"特征值与特征向量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】因为 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}$ 为 $A$ 的特征值 1 对应的两个线性无关的特征向量，故 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}$ 仍为特征值 1 的两个线性无关的特征向量；因为 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 为 $A$ 的特征值 $-1$ 的特征向量，故 $-\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 仍为特征值 $-1$ 的特征向量，因为特征向量与特征值的排序一一对应，故只需 $P=(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},-\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2})$，","就有 $P^{-1}AP=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\ 0&-1&0\\\\ 0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-7","num":7,"desc":"事件概率运算","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】","$P(A\\bar{B}\\bar{C})+P(\\bar{A}B\\bar{C})+P(\\bar{A}\\bar{B}C)$","$=P(A\\cap\\overline{B\\cup C})+P(B\\cap\\overline{A\\cup C})+P(C\\cap\\overline{A\\cup B})$","$=P(A)-P(AB)-P(AC)+P(ABC)+P(B)-P(AB)-P(BC)+P(ABC)$","$+P(C)-P(AC)-P(BC)+P(ABC)$","又 $ABC\\subset AB$，$P(ABC)\\leqslant P(AB)=0,P(ABC)=0$，","原式$=\\dfrac{1}{4}-\\dfrac{1}{12}+\\dfrac{1}{4}-\\dfrac{1}{12}+\\dfrac{1}{4}-\\dfrac{1}{12}-\\dfrac{1}{12}=\\dfrac{5}{12}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-8","num":8,"desc":"二维正态分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】由二维正态分布可知 $X\\sim N(0,1)$， $Y\\sim N(0,4)$， $\\rho_{XY}=-\\dfrac{1}{2}$","$D(X+Y)=DX+DY+2\\rho_{XY}\\sqrt{DX}\\sqrt{DY}=3$，","所以 $X+Y\\sim N(0,3)$，$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}(X+Y)\\sim N(0,1)$.","又 $\\mathrm{cov}(X,X+Y)=\\mathrm{cov}(X,X)+\\mathrm{cov}(X,Y)=DX+\\rho_{XY}\\sqrt{DX}\\sqrt{DY}=0$，","所以 $X$ 与 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}(X+Y)$ 独立."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-9","num":9,"desc":"偏导数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（9）【答案】$\\left.dz\\right|_{(0,\\pi)}=(\\pi-1)dx-dy$","【解析】$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=\\dfrac{y+\\cos(x+y)}{1+\\left[xy+\\sin(x+y)\\right]^{2}},\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=\\dfrac{x+\\cos(x+y)}{1+\\left[xy+\\sin(x+y)\\right]^{2}}$，将 $x=0,y=\\pi$ 带入可知，","$\\left.dz\\right|_{(0,\\pi)}=(\\pi-1)dx-dy$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-10","num":10,"desc":"隐函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（10）【答案】$y=x-1$","【解析】在 $x+y+e^{2xy}=0$ 两侧同时对 $x$ 求导有$1+\\dfrac{dy}{dx}+e^{2xy}\\left(2y+2x\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\\right)=0$，将","$x=0,y=-1$ 带入可知$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=1$，所以切线方程为 $y=x-1.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-11","num":11,"desc":"导数经济应用","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（11）【答案】$Q=8$","【解析】由 $Q(p)=\\dfrac{800}{P+3}-2$ 可知 $p=\\dfrac{800}{Q+2}-3$，则利润函数为","$L(Q)=\\left(\\dfrac{800}{Q+2}-3\\right)Q-(100+13Q),\\quad\\dfrac{dL(Q)}{dQ}=\\dfrac{1600}{\\left(Q+2\\right)^{2}}-16$，令$\\dfrac{dL(Q)}{dQ}=0$可得，$Q=8$，","此时$\\dfrac{d^{2}L(Q)}{dQ^{2}}=-\\dfrac{3200}{\\left(Q+2\\right)^{3}}<0$，故取得最大利润."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-12","num":12,"desc":"定积分应用","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（12）【答案】$\\pi(\\ln 2-\\dfrac{1}{3})$","【解析】由题意列式得$V=\\int_{0}^{1}2\\pi x\\left(\\dfrac{1}{1+x^{2}}-\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)dx=\\pi\\left(\\ln(1+x^{2})-\\dfrac{1}{3}x^{3}\\right)\\left|\\right._{0}^{1}=\\ \\pi(\\ln 2-\\dfrac{1}{3})\\ .$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-13","num":13,"desc":"行列式计算","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（13）【答案】$a^{2}(a^{2}-4).$","【解析】","原式$=a\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&1&1\\\\ 0&a&1&-1\\\\ -1&1&a&0\\\\ 1&-1&0&a\\end{vmatrix}=a\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&1&1\\\\ 0&a&1&-1\\\\ 0&2&a+1&1\\\\ 0&0&a&a\\end{vmatrix}=a\\begin{vmatrix}a&1&-1\\\\ 2&a+1&1\\\\ 0&a&a\\end{vmatrix}=a^{2}\\begin{vmatrix}a&2&-1\\\\ 2&a&1\\\\ 0&0&1\\end{vmatrix}=a^{2}(a^{2}-4).$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-14","num":14,"desc":"随机变量函数的分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（14）【答案】$\\dfrac{8}{7}$","【解析】$P\\left\\{Y=0\\right\\}=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}P\\left\\{X=3n\\right\\}=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{8^{n}}=\\dfrac{1}{7}$","$P\\left\\{Y=1\\right\\}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}P\\left\\{X=3n+1\\right\\}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{2}\\dfrac{1}{8^{n}}=\\dfrac{4}{7}$","$P\\left\\{Y=2\\right\\}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}P\\left\\{X=3n+2\\right\\}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{4}\\dfrac{1}{8^{n}}=\\dfrac{2}{7}$","所以 $EY=0\\times\\dfrac{1}{7}+1\\times\\dfrac{4}{7}+2\\times\\dfrac{2}{7}=\\dfrac{8}{7}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-15","num":15,"desc":"等价无穷小","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（15）【答案】$a=1,b=-\\dfrac{1}{2}e$","【解析】$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{\\left(1+\\dfrac{1}{n}\\right)^{n}-e}{\\dfrac{b}{n^{a}}}=\\dfrac{1}{b}\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{e^{n\\ln\\left(1+\\frac{1}{n}\\right)}-e}{\\dfrac{1}{n^{a}}}=\\dfrac{e}{b}\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{e^{n\\ln\\left(1+\\frac{1}{n}\\right)-1}-1}{\\dfrac{1}{n^{a}}}$","$=\\dfrac{e}{b}\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{n\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{n})-1}{\\dfrac{1}{n^{a}}}=\\dfrac{e}{b}\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{n\\left(\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{n})-\\dfrac{1}{n}\\right)}{\\dfrac{1}{n^{a}}}$","由于 $\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{n})-\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sim\\dfrac{1}{2}\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}\\left(n\\to\\infty\\right)$，则 $a=1$，且①式 $\\dfrac{-\\dfrac{1}{2}e}{b}=1$，得 $b=-\\dfrac{1}{2}e.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-16","num":16,"desc":"二元函数极值","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（16）【答案】极小值为 $f=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{6},\\dfrac{1}{12}\\right)=-\\dfrac{1}{216}$","【解析】$\\begin{cases}f_{x}'\\left(x,y\\right)=3x^{2}-y=0\\\\ f_{y}'\\left(x,y\\right)=24y^{2}-x=0\\end{cases}$","所以 $\\begin{cases}x=0\\\\ y=0\\end{cases}$ 或 $\\begin{cases}x=\\dfrac{1}{6}\\\\ y=\\dfrac{1}{12}\\end{cases}$，所以驻点为 $\\left(0,0\\right)$ 或 $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{6},\\dfrac{1}{12}\\right).$","$A=f_{xx}''\\left(x,y\\right)=6x$，$B=f_{xy}''\\left(x,y\\right)=-1$，$C=f_{yy}''\\left(x,y\\right)=48y$ 代入 $\\left(0,0\\right)$，此时 $AC-B^{2}<0$ 所以不是极值点，代入 $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{6},\\dfrac{1}{12}\\right)$，$AC-B^{2}>0$ 且 $A>0$，所以 $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{6},\\dfrac{1}{12}\\right)$ 是极小值点，$f=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{6},\\dfrac{1}{12}\\right)=-\\dfrac{1}{216}$ 为极小值."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-17","num":17,"desc":"二阶常系数齐次微分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（17）【答案】（I）$f(x)=e^{-x}\\cos 2x$ （II）$\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_{n}=\\dfrac{1}{5}\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}e^{-n\\pi}=\\dfrac{1}{5}\\dfrac{1}{e^{\\pi}-1}$","【解析】（I）由 $y''+2y'+5y=0$ 得 $\\lambda^{2}+2\\lambda+5=0$，解得 $\\lambda_{1,2}=-1\\pm 2i$，","则 $f(x)=e^{-x}\\left(C_{1}\\cos 2x+C_{2}\\sin 2x\\right)$，又由 $f(0)=1,f'(0)=-1$ 得 $C_{1}=1,C_{2}=0$，","则 $f(x)=e^{-x}\\cos 2x.$","（II）$a_{n}=\\int_{n\\pi}^{+\\infty}e^{-x}\\cos 2xdx=\\dfrac{1}{5}\\left(-e^{-x}\\cos 2x+2e^{-x}\\sin 2x\\right)\\Big|_{n\\pi}^{+\\infty}$","$=\\dfrac{1}{5}e^{-x}\\left(-\\cos 2x+2\\sin 2x\\right)\\Big|_{n\\pi}^{+\\infty}=\\dfrac{1}{5}e^{-n\\pi}$，则 $\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_{n}=\\dfrac{1}{5}\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}e^{-n\\pi}=\\dfrac{1}{5}\\dfrac{1}{e^{\\pi}-1}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-18","num":18,"desc":"二重积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（18）【答案】$\\dfrac{3\\pi^{2}}{128}$","【解析】设 $\\iint_{D}f(x,y)dxdy=A$，则 $f(x,y)=y\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}+Ax$，","两边同取积分得 $A=\\iint_{D}f(x,y)dxdy=\\iint_{D}y\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}dxdy+\\iint_{D}Axdxdy$","$=\\iint_{D}y\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}dxdy=2\\iint_{D_{1}}y\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}dxdy=2\\int_{0}^{1}\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}dx\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}}ydy$","$=\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(1-x^{2}\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}dx\\xlongequal{x=\\sin t}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\cos^{4}tdt=\\dfrac{3}{4}\\dfrac{1}{2}\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}=\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}.$","则 $f(x,y)=f(x,y)+\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}x$，$\\iint_{D}xf(x,y)dxdy=\\iint_{D}x\\left(y\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}+\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}x\\right)dxdy$","$=\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}\\cdot\\iint_{D}x^{2}dxdy=\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}\\cdot 2\\iint_{D_{1}}x^{2}dxdy=\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}\\cdot 2\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{2}\\iint_{D_{1}}\\left(x^{2}+y^{2}\\right)dxdy$","$=\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{1}r^{2}rdr=\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}\\cdot\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{4}=\\dfrac{3\\pi^{2}}{128}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-19","num":19,"desc":"拉格朗日中值定理","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（19）【解析】（I）证明：（I）$M=0$ 时，则 $f(x)=0$，显然成立.","$M>0$ 时，不妨设在点 $c(\\in(0,2))$ 处取得最大值 $\\left|f(c)\\right|=M.$","由拉格朗日中值定理得，存在 $\\xi_{1}\\in(0,c)$，使得 $\\left|f'(\\xi_{1})\\right|=\\left|\\dfrac{f(c)-f(0)}{c-0}\\right|=\\dfrac{M}{c}$；","存在 $\\xi_{2}\\in(c,2)$，使得 $\\left|f'(\\xi_{2})\\right|=\\left|\\dfrac{f(2)-f(c)}{2-c}\\right|=\\dfrac{M}{2-c}$；","所以 $\\left(\\dfrac{M}{c}-M\\right)\\left(\\dfrac{M}{2-c}-M\\right)=-M^{2}\\dfrac{\\left(c-1\\right)^{2}}{c\\left(2-c\\right)}\\leqslant 0$，即 $M$ 介于 $\\dfrac{M}{c}$ 与 $\\dfrac{M}{2-c}$ 之间，","从而有 $\\left|f'(\\xi_{1})\\right|\\geqslant M$ 或 $\\left|f'(\\xi_{2})\\right|\\geqslant M$，结论得证.","（II）当 $c\\neq 1$ 时，采用反证法，假设 $M>0$.","则 $\\left|f'(\\xi_{1})\\right|>M$ 或 $\\left|f'(\\xi_{2})\\right|>M$，与已知矛盾，假设不成立.","当 $c=1$ 时，此时 $\\left|f(1)\\right|=M$，易知 $f'(1)=0$.","不妨设 $f(1)=M$，则 $G(x)=f(x)-Mx,0\\leqslant x\\leqslant 1$；则有 $G'(x)=f'(x)-M\\leqslant 0$，从而 $G(x)$ 单调递减.","又 $G(0)=G(1)=0$，从而 $G(x)=0$，即 $f(x)=Mx,0\\leqslant x\\leqslant 1.$","因此 $f^{\\prime}_{-}(1)=M$，从而 $M=0$。综上所述，$M=0$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-20","num":20,"desc":"二次型","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（20）【解析】（I）设 $f=x^{T}Ax$，其中 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2\\\\ -2&4\\end{pmatrix}$，经正交变换 $x=Qy$，","$f=y^{T}Q^{T}AQy=y^{T}By$，其中 $B=\\begin{pmatrix}a&2\\\\ 2&b\\end{pmatrix}$；","可知 $Q^{T}AQ=Q^{-1}AQ=B$，即 $A$ 相似于 $B$，则 $\\begin{cases}tr(A)=tr(B)\\\\ \\left|A\\right|=\\left|B\\right|\\end{cases}$ 解得 $a=4,b=1$ ；","（II）设 $P_{1}^{-1}AP_{1}=\\Lambda,P_{2}^{-1}BP_{2}=\\Lambda$，则 $\\left(P_{1}P_{2}^{-1}\\right)^{-1}A\\left(P_{1}P_{2}^{-1}\\right)=B$，因此 $Q=P_{1}P_{2}^{-1}$；","由 $\\left|\\lambdaE-A\\right|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-1&2\\\\ 2&\\lambda-4\\end{vmatrix}=0$，解出 $\\lambda_{1}=0,\\lambda_{2}=5$；","$\\left(0E-A\\right)=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&2\\\\ 2&-4\\end{pmatrix}\\rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2\\\\ 0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，故 $\\xi_{1}=\\left(2,1\\right)^{T}$；","$\\left(5E-A\\right)=\\begin{pmatrix}4&2\\\\ 2&1\\end{pmatrix}\\rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\\\ 0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，故 $\\xi_{2}=\\left(1,-2\\right)^{T}$；故 $P_{1}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\\\ 1&-2\\end{pmatrix}$；","$\\left(0E-B\\right)=\\begin{pmatrix}-4&-2\\\\ -2&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\\\ 0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，故 $\\eta_{1}=\\left(1,-2\\right)^{T}$；","$\\left(5E-B\\right)=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2\\\\ -2&4\\end{pmatrix}\\rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2\\\\ 0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，故 $\\eta_{2}=\\left(2,1\\right)^{T}$；$P_{2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\ -2&1\\end{pmatrix}$；","综上所述，$Q=P_{1}P_{2}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{4}{5}&-\\dfrac{3}{5}\\\\ -\\dfrac{3}{5}&-\\dfrac{4}{5}\\end{pmatrix}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-21","num":21,"desc":"线性无关","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（21）【解析】（I）$\\alpha$ 不是特征向量且 $\\alpha\\neq 0$，则 $A\\alpha\\neq k\\alpha$，即 $A\\alpha,\\alpha$ 线性无关，故 $P=\\left(\\alpha,A\\alpha\\right)$ 可逆.","（II）设 $P^{-1}AP=B$，则 $AP=PB$，即","$A(\\alpha,A\\alpha)=\\left(A\\alpha,A^{2}\\alpha\\right)=\\left(A\\alpha,6\\alpha-A\\alpha\\right)=\\left(\\alpha,A\\alpha\\right)\\begin{pmatrix}0&6\\\\ 1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$","所以 $P^{-1}AP=B=\\begin{pmatrix}0&6\\\\ 1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$，则 $A\\sim B$，","$\\left|\\lambdaE-B\\right|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&-6\\\\ -1&\\lambda+1\\end{vmatrix}=\\left(\\lambda+3\\right)\\left(\\lambda-2\\right)=0$","$\\lambda_{1}=-3,\\lambda_{2}=2$，因为 $\\lambda_{1}\\neq\\lambda_{2}$，所以 $B$ 可以相似对角化，则 $A$ 可以相似对角化."]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-22","num":22,"desc":"二维均匀分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（22）【解析】由题意 $f\\left(x,y\\right)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{2}{\\pi},\\left(x,y\\right)\\in D\\\\ 0,\\left(x,y\\right)\\notin D\\end{cases}$，所以可计算","$P\\left(Z_{1}=0,Z_{2}=0\\right)=P\\left(X-Y\\leq 0,X+Y\\leq 0\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{4}$；","$P\\left(Z_{1}=0,Z_{2}=1\\right)=P\\left(X-Y\\leq 0,X+Y>0\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{2}$；","$P\\left(Z_{1}=1,Z_{2}=0\\right)=P\\left(X-Y>0,X+Y\\leq 0\\right)=0$；","$P\\left(Z_{1}=1,Z_{2}=1\\right)=P\\left(X-Y>0,X+Y>0\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{4}.$","可得 $\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline Z_{1}\\backslash Z_{2}&0&1\\\\ \\hline 0&\\dfrac{1}{4}&\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\ \\hline 1&0&\\dfrac{1}{4}\\\\ \\hline\\end{array}$","由（1）可计算 $E\\left(Z_{1}\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{4},E\\left(Z_{2}\\right)=\\dfrac{3}{4},D\\left(Z_{1}\\right)=\\dfrac{3}{16},D\\left(Z_{2}\\right)=\\dfrac{3}{16},E\\left(Z_{1}Z_{2}\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{4}.$","所以可得 $\\rho=\\dfrac{Cov\\left(Z_{1},Z_{2}\\right)}{\\sqrt{DZ_{1}}\\sqrt{DZ_{2}}}=\\dfrac{E\\left(Z_{1}Z_{2}\\right)-EZ_{1}\\cdot EZ_{2}}{\\sqrt{DZ_{1}}\\sqrt{DZ_{2}}}=\\dfrac{1}{3}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2020-23","num":23,"desc":"分布函数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2020数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["（23）【解析】（I）$P\\left\\{T>t\\right\\}=1-P\\left\\{T\\leq t\\right\\}=1-F\\left(t\\right)=e^{-\\left(\\frac{t}{\\theta}\\right)^{m}}$，","$P\\left\\{T>t+s\\mid T>s\\right\\}=\\dfrac{P\\left\\{T>t+s,T>s\\right\\}}{P\\left\\{T>s\\right\\}}=\\dfrac{e^{-\\left(\\frac{s+t}{\\theta}\\right)^{m}}}{e^{-\\left(\\frac{s}{\\theta}\\right)^{m}}}=e^{\\left(\\frac{s}{\\theta}\\right)^{m}-\\left(\\frac{s+t}{\\theta}\\right)^{m}}$；","（II）求得密度函数 $f\\left(t\\right)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{mt^{m-1}}{\\theta^{m}}e^{-\\left(\\frac{t}{\\theta}\\right)^{m}},&t\\geq 0\\\\ 0,&t<0\\end{cases}$，","故可构造似然函数为 $L\\left(\\theta\\right)=\\dfrac{m^{n}\\prod\\limits_{i=1}^{n}t_{i}^{m-1}}{\\theta^{mn}}e^{-\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\left(\\frac{t_{i}}{\\theta}\\right)^{m}},\\quad t_{i}>0,i=1,2,3,...,n,$","取对数 $\\ln L\\left(\\theta\\right)=n\\ln m+\\left(m-1\\right)\\ln\\left(t_{1}t_{2}\\cdots t_{n}\\right)-mn\\ln\\theta-\\dfrac{1}{\\theta^{m}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}t_{i}^{m}$","求导可得 $\\dfrac{d\\ln L\\left(\\theta\\right)}{d\\theta}=-\\dfrac{mn}{\\theta}+m\\dfrac{1}{\\theta^{m+1}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}t_{i}^{m}=0,$","解出 $\\theta$ 的极大似然估计为 $\\hat{\\theta}=\\sqrt[m]{\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}t_{i}^{m}}$ ."]}]}]}